Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:06.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:17.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:33.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:40.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:48.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:54.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:58.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:02.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:09.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:20.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很近了 就在森林那一带
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尾随着四魂碎片的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧遇遭到 奈落的妖怪袭击的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落驱使妖怪取回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埋藏在琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜于和琥珀重逢的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀已被奈落消除记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法想起珊瑚的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从奈落的手里逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的陷阱不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是想要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我除了相信还能怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,率领大群妖怪的神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现在我们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要取回埋藏在 琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若四魂碎片被取走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护琥珀免遭那些家伙的毒手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉一行人阻止了妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我则和琥珀一起逃入森林中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能想起那个人的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么可怕的东西 我非想起来不可
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:15.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔之矢用光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第50话 那张脸绝不会自心底消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:04:01.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会再把你交给奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你听好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要尽可能牵制神乐她们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了抓个逃走的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带了这样一大群来 这样刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全被奈落的把戏唬住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好演吧 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里碰见真是百年难得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就顺便杀光你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的头我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和刚才琥珀完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀啊 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 这点伤没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 跟在戈薇身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 很痛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道珊瑚她…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.27,0:07:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不拔刀啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付你们不需要用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你还没熟悉刀的用法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就使用爪子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头脑真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样就用砍的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀法变的这么迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…还是重的无法随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了牵制这群妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须让它们以为
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀似乎还在这间屋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还敢看别的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来屋子里是空的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是为了巧妙的拖住我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没跟我一决胜负呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要被骗了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐也好 这些妖怪也好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目的应该是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们连一个人 都没有追过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她们打算将我们困住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许被困住的反而是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果奈落真正的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是琥珀的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她追着琥珀进入森林中…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.55,0:10:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然琥珀也是奈落的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才注意到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过已经来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然利用琥珀对戈薇下手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个使用破魔之箭 叫做戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:49.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:58.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:10:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒虫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来啊 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连毒蜂也吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你去追珊瑚还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 弥勒 你别死喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要转个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能连你也吸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恕不奉陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也快点去追犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小鬼竟然装出
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:22.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连虫也舍不得杀的模样来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然还没 从奈落手里解放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.11,0:13:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了伤害戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取四魂碎片而来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其让你继续受到奈落的利用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁可…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:28.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 我马上就让你自由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你一个人走的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就会去陪你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点去追珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你被琥珀弄伤了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮肉伤而已 而且那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他想杀我一定做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他却没那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚她不知道这些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也许打算把琥珀杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀没有一击让戈薇致命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么没有遵从奈落的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使被操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀还残留着人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得不太好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:27.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是姐弟呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不要再离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一的亲弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别阻止我 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:57.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:16:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了琥珀的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让奈落称心如意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不给我醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同命令所说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫琥珀杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀绝对不会违抗奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:37.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想为什么琥珀会丧失记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是奈落操纵了他的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说也对 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀自己也不愿想起往事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不愿想起的记忆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在琥珀面前不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本人都想忘记的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落就让他忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:27.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要操纵琥珀纯洁的心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落而言是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚和驱魔师的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都给我想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还想活下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能想起来并面对它的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心就永远受奈落的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:19:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藏在体内的四魂碎片会被取走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会被那家伙给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得还真狠呢 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是想起自己做过什么的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子…真的会彻底崩溃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他忘了一切的死去 也是为了他好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这下又…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:05.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下又回到起点了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是找麻烦的姐弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早告诉你不要那么冲动啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确命令琥珀杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀却没有杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:26.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他还残存着人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不能杀琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把他活生生的抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把你的性命延长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至让你忘记一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然没有杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在你还想取回人类的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将一切都回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就暂时再让你活一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一切都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 那个人的脸…无法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:29.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:40.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:48.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:52.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:56.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:03.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:11.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:18.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.35,0:23:25.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:33.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子遭到盗贼的袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐无道的盗贼首领 蛾天丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是化成人形的蛾妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉和弥勒法师一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被困在毒茧当中了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.67,0:24:00.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同一时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找犬夜叉妖化之谜的杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.27,0:24:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然从老木妖怪那里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得知一个恐怖的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.45,0:24:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的心被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
